{"input":{"title":"Men's Plumber – Not Looking at Your Sink Tee","handle":"mens-plumber-not-looking-at-your-sink-graphic-tee","status":"DRAFT","vendor":"Graphic Tees Co.","productType":"T-Shirt","tags":["graphic-tees-for-men","funny-graphic-tees","retro-graphic-tees","ai-art","intake-done"],"descriptionHtml":"<h3>The Story</h3>\n<p>A plumber in overalls and a cap leans back in a striped lawn chair at the cookout, eyes shut, burger in hand, while a faucet drips into a bucket nobody is watching, and the shirt says OFF DUTY. NOT LOOKING AT YOUR SINK. This plumber shirt is for the plumber who gets asked to take a quick look at every family party.</p>\n<p>The print is a 1950s cookout scene: a relaxed man in blue overalls and a cap tipped back in a red, white and blue lawn chair, a burger on a paper plate, a pipe wrench tucked in his pocket, a curtained kitchen window behind him with a faucet dripping into a metal bucket. OFF DUTY. sits above in small collegiate capitals and NOT LOOKING AT YOUR SINK. below in two lines of slab letters.</p>\n<p>Wear it to the backyard cookout, the in-laws' Sunday dinner or the job-site lunch, or hand it to the plumber who never gets a day without a leak question. Original art, made for Graphic Tees Co. and printed the day you order it.</p>\n<h3>Details &amp; Fit</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Classic unisex fit, crew neck</li>\n<li>100% combed, ring-spun cotton (heather colors contain polyester)</li>\n<li>Fabric weight: 4.2 oz/yd² — lightweight</li>\n<li>Pre-shrunk, side-seamed construction, shoulder-to-shoulder taping</li>\n<li>Sizes S–4XL</li>\n<li>Colors: Black, Navy, Dark Grey Heather, Heather Forest, Maroon, Natural, Ash, Athletic Heather</li>\n<li>Blank product sourced from Nicaragua, Honduras, or the US</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Questions</h3>\n<p><strong>What is the Not Looking at Your Sink tee?</strong><br>It is a men's graphic tee from Graphic Tees Co. showing a plumber relaxing in a lawn chair beside a dripping faucet, lettered OFF DUTY. NOT LOOKING AT YOUR SINK. It is printed on a Bella+Canvas 3001 in 4.2 oz cotton, so it stays light and cool at a summer cookout.</p>\n<p><strong>How does the unisex tee fit?</strong><br>This Graphic Tees Co. tee is a true unisex cut in sizes S through 4XL with a crew neck and side-seamed body. Order your usual size for a classic fit or size up one for a looser look. If the size is off, the first exchange is free.</p>\n<p><strong>What is it made of and how do I wash it?</strong><br>The tee is 100% combed, ring-spun cotton, with heather colors blending in some polyester, at a lightweight 4.2 oz. Wash it inside out in cold water with like colors and tumble dry low. That keeps the red, mustard and navy inks crisp wash after wash.</p>\n<p><strong>Is it a good gift for a plumber?</strong><br>Yes. It suits the plumber, the apprentice and the dad everyone asks about their sink. It comes from Graphic Tees Co. at $24.99 in eight colors, sizes S through 4XL, and the free size exchange makes it safe as a birthday, Father's Day or Christmas gift from the family he fixes things for.</p>\n<p><strong>Can I get it by Christmas?</strong><br>Order by about December 8 and your Graphic Tees Co. plumber tee should arrive before Christmas. Each shirt is printed the day you order it, so ship times vary a little by location. Orders over $45 ship free, and the free size exchange covers a wrong guess.</p>\n","seo":{"title":"Plumber Shirt: Off Duty, Not Looking at Your Sink","description":"A funny plumber shirt: a plumber off duty beside a dripping faucet. Unisex 4.2 oz cotton tee, S-4XL, printed to order. Free size exchange."},"productOptions":[{"name":"Color","values":[{"name":"Black"},{"name":"Navy"},{"name":"Dark Grey Heather"},{"name":"Heather Forest"},{"name":"Maroon"},{"name":"Natural"},{"name":"Ash"},{"name":"Athletic Heather"}]},{"name":"Size","values":[{"name":"S"},{"name":"M"},{"name":"L"},{"name":"XL"},{"name":"2XL"},{"name":"3XL"},{"name":"4XL"}]}],"variants":[{"optionValues":[{"optionName":"Co